| Checkbox, Radio card | `Checkbox`, `RadioCard` | `Checkbox`, `Radio.Card` |
| Tabs (Underline, Pill) | `Tabs` | `Tabs` |
| Segmented Control | `SegmentedControl` | `SegmentedControl` |
| Table, Table Pagination | `Table`, `Pagination` | `Table`, `Pagination` |
| Drawer (Header, Body, Footer slots) | `Drawer` | `Drawer` |
| Modal / dialog | `Dialog` | `Modal` |
| Step, Stepper | `Stepper` | `Stepper` |
| Progress (ring, line), Progress track | `ProgressRing`, `ProgressLine`, `ProgressTrack` | `RingProgress`, `Progress` |
